*&      --> P_INPUT2
*&      <-- LV_OUTPUT
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
FORM add  USING    pv_input1 TYPE numc2
                   pv_input2 TYPE numc3
          CHANGING pv_output TYPE numc4.

  pv_output = pv_input1 + p_input2.

ENDFORM.
